{"version":1,"content":"<p>坐落於荃灣西如心酒店41樓高空之上的 Bar 41，上月初正式揭幕。</p><p>耗資逾港幣1,100萬元精心翻新，這個全景觀酒吧及酒廊以嶄新面貌登場，結合當代設計、優質美酒佳餚、兼具品味與價值的體驗及由晝至夜的多元氛圍，為賓客帶來耳目一新的餐飲及社交空</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:14.722836+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_hash":"86852136f49a7e95491756137f06176fb2846c84fc5ceab4024fe0685c2ab9a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}